{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:7464dcbe8125c639","name":"Point-Blank Shot","source":{"id":"source:reference-7464dcbe8125c639","title":"Point-Blank Shot","revision":18410,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:05:17Z","sha256":"7bb01bbf554c3aa5f0549dae04488547c7ecb819fdf47807d66a99dc7fe5eed5","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18410","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Point-Blank%20Shot&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-7464dcbe8125c639","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are skilled at making well-placed shots with ranged weapons at Point-Blank ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," You get a +1 bonus on attack and damage rolls with ranged weapons against opponents within Point-Blank ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," This Feat works normally with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Weapons"},". However, if you are using ",{"tag":"a","children":["Missiles or Torpedoes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Missiles_or_Torpedoes"}," and you miss with your attack roll, the projectile does not gain the benefit of this feat for the second attack roll.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Point-Blank Shot, Rangefinders, and Targeting Scopes"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Under most circumstances, a character with the ","Point-Blank Shot"," Feat receives a bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls only when the target is within his or her weapon's Point-Blank ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The use of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Targeting Scope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Targeting_Scope","referenceId":"reference:d75342116ec32b75"}," does not change how far your target is from you, so taking an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," Action with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Targeting Scope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Targeting_Scope","referenceId":"reference:d75342116ec32b75"}," on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Rifle","referenceId":"reference:fb78a988cbf9557f"}," to attack a target that is 50 squares away does not give you the +1 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls that you would receive if the target were within 30 squares. This is the same for the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rangefinder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rangefinder","referenceId":"reference:b9f8f98f87db41c9"}," upgrade, which negates the penalty for attacking a target that is at Short ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
